  "prefLabel": "Elec 301.01 Electrical installation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Elec 301.01 “Electrical installation” means electrical installation as defined in RSA 319-C:2, III, including the installation of framing or other supporting structures if such structures perform an electrical function according to the manufacturer’s instructions.\n\nSource. #12334, eff 7-22-17 (See Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Elec 300)",
